# Temporary ad-hoc QA evidence (periodically clear local contents)
/qa/

# The generic publish/ rule above case-insensitively swallows the Kiota-generated
# Publish/ request-builder folder on Windows; keep the generated client complete.
!modernisation/src/Platform/Concerto.Web.Platform/ApiClient/Generated/**/Publish/
!modernisation/src/Platform/Concerto.Web.Platform/ApiClient/Generated/**/Publish/**

# QA screenshots - uploaded directly to ADO, not committed
